    "Beinecke MS 408, f89r2 and right panel, expanded crop starting at native x5270, https://collections.library.yale.edu/iiif/2/1006233/5270,0,3808,3777/full/0/default.jpg",
    "Yale f35v, https://collections.library.yale.edu/manifests/oid/2002046/canvas/1006143 and https://collections.library.yale.edu/iiif/2/1006143/full/1400,/0/default.jpg",
    "René Zandbergen, Quire 15, fragment numbering 33–38 and 40–49 and proposed resemblance to f35v, https://www.voynich.nu/q15/index.html",
    "Zandbergen, Villa Mondragone (2012), PDF p. 24 for f35v and BnF Latin 6823 f60r, https://voynich.nu/papers/Voynich100_RZ_2012.pdf#page=24",
    "BnF Latin 6823 f60r, right-hand ivy comparison, https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/btv1b6000517p/f127.image . Reproduced scan directly reviewed at https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BnF_Latin_6823,_f.060r.jpg",
    "Siv Bugge Vatne, The Morphology of the Voynich Plants (2022), section Drawings from memory, https://crackingthevoynichcipher.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/5_the_morphology_of_the_voynich_plants_siv_bugge_vatne_2022.pdf",
    "Draft N-005, https://github.com/Ayan-Bandyopadhyay/voynich-swarm/pull/223; lexical status check, vs/judge.py lines 495–545 in the current scorer."
